stinguish `CORE_OBSERVED`, `PROVIDER_ATTESTED`, `POSTCONDITION_RECONCILED`, `CAUSALITY_PROVEN`, `CURRENT_STATE_MATCHES_NO_CAUSALITY`, `CONFLICTING_EVIDENCE`, `UNKNOWN`.

## PM-EVID-003 — Write-Ahead Admission

Evidence-required Host Action is not admitted until its minimum required initial record is durable.

## PM-EVID-004 — Evidence Capacity Reservation

Required lifecycle/final evidence capacity is action-bound and reserved before dispatch. Reservation survives required restart boundaries and is released only at the contract-defined resolved/retention point.

## PM-EVID-005 — Storage Failure After Dispatch

If required final evidence cannot be persisted, do not report a clean terminal result. The action remains/re-enters unresolved reconciliation state.

## PM-EVID-006 — Retention Ordering

Replay/idempotency/reconciliation metadata survives at least the entire legal execution/result/reconciliation horizon.

## PM-EVID-007 — Evidence Expiry

Intentional authorized expiry is `EVIDENCE_EXPIRED`, not fictitious absence.

## PM-EVID-008 — Evidence Corruption

Corruption is explicit; damaged records are preserved and marked untrusted.

## PM-EVID-009 — Evidence Integrity

Security-grade integrity uses keyed/signature/tamper-evident mechanisms as required, with algorithm/key epochs for historical verification.

## PM-EVID-010 — Rollback-Evident Evidence Class

Where policy requires evidence to reveal full-storage rollback, the evidence durability class is bound to the rollback-resistant security anchor.

## PM-EVID-011 — EvidenceProjection

Canonical evidence and client-visible evidence are separate. EvidenceProjection applies current disclosure policy and may coarsen protected fields without falsifying the canonical record.

## PM-EVID-012 — ActionResultProjection

Canonical `NO_CHANGE`, prior state, actor/dependency details, or other sensitive result facts may be truthfully coarsened for the client when policy requires.

## PM-EVID-013 — Mutation Authority Does Not Imply Disclosure

A principal may be allowed to cause an effect without being allowed to enumerate every dependent object or full evidence detail.

## PM-EVID-014 — Orphaned Action Discovery

Core provides authorized discovery/reconciliation of recent unresolved actions. Creator provenance remains immutable; a new authorized Manager may reconcile without becoming creator.

## PM-EVID-015 — Cross-Record Correlation Retention

If a correlated Action/Transaction record expires earlier than the other, the surviving record keeps stable correlation and reports the other side `EXPIRED/UNAVAILABLE` rather than silently dropping the relationship.

